  <p id="c-jinshu-032-jin080-xumai:daoshi" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">會有道士<persName id="c-jinshu-032-jin080-xumai:daoshi:m0004" ref="972_dh9_hz4">許邁</persName>者，朝臣時望多稱其得道。帝從容問焉，答曰：「<persName id="c-jinshu-032-jin080-xumai:daoshi:m0028" ref="972_dh9_hz4">邁</persName>是好山水人，本無道術</p>
